@title Supplier invoice number pattern
@subtitle Expected versus actual for every sample line, starting from INV-\d{4}-\d{6}
@width wide

! A line counts as matched only when the pattern matches the whole line, because the goal is to accept valid invoice numbers and nothing else. The brief says 11 lines but lists 13 (3 valid, 2 valid with a branch suffix, 8 not valid), so the scores below are out of 13.

